          "content": "DRAWN: desktop and mobile homepage compositions with complete continuations. Selected work uses text-only showcases: AlaBal, then Personal Website. More projects contains eight live-site projects; CraftMind and FamilyHub removed. Full career, skills, education, languages, contact and motto retained.",
          "lineHeight": 1.625,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 16,
