          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Graphite / porcelain: 14.65:1\nSlate / porcelain: 5.91:1\nBlueprint / porcelain: 6.65:1\nWhite / blueprint: 7.07:1\nSlate / placeholder matte: 5.54:1\nDark primary / background: 16.14:1",
          "lineHeight": 1.625,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "wUHUD",
          "name": "Checks",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "PASS: AlaBal then Personal Website; Master projects appear once; live-site project, career, skill and education content transcribed or concisely paraphrased; no newly fabricated metrics/screenshots; current compositions visually reviewed. Key color contrasts previously measured above 4.5:1.\nNOT CHECKED: 360/430/tablet/landscape/wide, German/RTL/200% text, live keyboard/screen reader/navigation or persistence. No code, build or deployment. Contact motion is a specification, not implemented animation.",
          "lineHeight": 1.625,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "w6Rga",
          "name": "Next phase gate",
          "fill": "$brand-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Await homepage direction approval before drawing detail pages, admin collection/Add/edit and full validation/save states, Dark reference screens and responsive/localization stress cases. Confirm AlaBal imagery, brand and product copy first.",
