          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "kLcnF",
          "name": "Future mapping",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Variables → CSS custom properties · headers → HeaderComponent · showcases/cards → ProjectsSectionComponent · homepage → HomePageRenderer · companion → shared public view component. Future engineering only; no code, builds or deployment in this task.",
