          "content": "Source: www.mohamedfaridelsherbini.com. Owner revision: remove all Selected work media and remove CraftMind and FamilyHub from desktop/mobile. No new product capabilities or outcomes introduced. AlaBal brand, stack and story still require confirmation.",
