          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "OWNER CORRECTION: long curly dark hair, not short or cropped. All twelve mini-avatar expressions must share shoulder-length curls and a full dark beard. Stylized approximation; likeness approval remains pending. Neutral default, greeting once, reduced-motion static; other expressions are art references only. Contact menu remains Email/LinkedIn/GitHub, not AI chat.",
          "lineHeight": 1.625,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
