              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "12 concepts\nNeutral · Happy · Greeting · Wink\nCurious · Thoughtful · Surprised · Excited\nConcerned · Sad · Frustrated · Sleepy\n\nUse neutral by default. Greeting once; focus may use curious. Other moods are an art library, not automated website behavior. No chat, listening, thinking-response or online status is implied.",
