          "type": "text",
          "id": "oe46y",
          "name": "Consistency rule",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Same full beard and moustache across all expressions. The avatar is built from one shared vector layer stack (hair, face, beard, moustache); only eyes, brows and mouth change per expression, so beard size is identical everywhere. Stylized approximation; likeness approval pending.",
